
  <sn><md>### Viewing Configured Remotes in rclone

After creating one or more remotes, you can view them using several Rclone commands.

##### List Remote Names

The simplest method is:

```bash
rclone listremotes
```

Example:

```text
gdrive:
onedrive:
backup:
```

This shows only the **remote names**, not their configuration details.

</md></sn>
